div><div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"offense\"><h4>Offense</h4><hr /><strong>Speed</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"speed\">  <li>Land 40 ft</li>  </ul><br />  <strong>Melee</strong> bite +12 (1d8+7 plus grab), 2 claws +13 (1d6+7)<br />   <ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\">  <li><strong>Space</strong> 10 ft</li>   <li><strong>Reach</strong> 5 ft</li>  </ul> <br />  <strong>Special Attacks</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"special-attacks\">  <li>pounce</li>  <li>rake <ul class=\"sbcCommaList sbcParensWrappedList\">  <li>2 Claws +13</li>  </ul></li>  </ul><br />  </div></div>    <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"statistics\"><h4>Statistics</h4><hr /><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"attributes\"><li><strong>Str</strong> 25</li><li><strong>Dex</strong> 15</li><li><strong>Con</strong> 17</li><li><strong>Int</strong> 2</li><li><strong>Wis</strong> 12</li><li><strong>Cha</strong> 10</li></ul><br /><ul class=\"sbcSemicolonList\" data-content=\"base-attack\"><li><strong>Base Atk</strong>+6</li><li><strong>CMB</strong> +14 (+18 grapple)</li><li><strong>CMD</strong> 26  (30 vs. trip) </li></ul><br />  <strong>Feats</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"feats\">  <li>Improved Initiative</li>  <li>Run</li>  <li>Skill Focus <ul class=\"sbcCommaList sbcParensWrappedList\">  <li>Perception</li>  </ul></li>  <li>Weapon Focus <ul class=\"sbcCommaList sbcParensWrappedList\">  <li>Claw</li>  </ul></li>  </ul><br />   <strong>Skills</strong><ul class=\"sbcCommaList\" data-content=\"skills\">  <li>Acrobatics +11</li>  <li>Perception +11</li>  <li>Stealth +7 (+11 in undergrowth)</li>  </ul>  <br />     </div>  <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"ecology\"><h4>Ecology</h4><hr />  <strong>Environment</strong>   warm plains or hills <br />   <strong>Organization</strong>  solitary, pair, or pride (3-8)<br />   <strong>Treasure</strong>  incidental   <br />  </div>      <div class=\"sbcSection\" data-content=\"description\"><h4> Description </h4><hr /><div class=\"sbcPreWrap\">\nDire lions, known locally as spotted lions or cave lions, are immense predators that can grow up to 15 feet long and weigh up to 3,500 pounds. Although they are merely animals, these large creatures seem to take an almost sadistic glee in playing with and tormenting their prey before eventually devouring it. As a result, many tribes view dire lions as the spawn of evil gods, and hunt them down as soon as their presence in a region becomes obvious.\n</div></div>  </div><hr class=\"sbcBorder\" /></div><p></p></div><br /><hr /><div class=\"rawInputContainer\" style=\"margin-top:15px\"><h2 style=\"text-align:middle;border:none;text-transform:uppercase;color:#000\">RAW INPUT</h2><hr /><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:14px\">    Dire Lion (CR 5)\nSource PFRPG Bestiary \nCR 5 \nXP 1,600 \nN Large Animal  \nInit +6; Senses low-light vision, scent; Perception +11   \nDefense   \nAC 15, touch 11, flat-footed 13 (+2 Dex, +4 natural, -1 size)\n\nhp 60 (8d8+24)\n\nFort +9, Ref +8, Will +3   \nOffense   \nSpd 40 ft. \nMelee bite +12 (1d8+7 plus grab), 2 claws +13 (1d6+7)\n\nSpace 10 ft.; Reach 5 ft. \nSpecial Attacks pounce, rake (2 claws +13, 1d6+7)\n\n\n\nStatistics   \nStr 25, Dex 15, Con 17, Int  2, Wis 12, Cha 10 \nBase Atk +6; CMB +14 (+18 grapple); CMD 26 (30 vs. trip)\n\nFeats Improved Initiative, Run, Skill Focus (Perception), Weapon Focus (claw)\n\nSkills Acrobatics +11, Perception +11, Stealth +7 (+11 in undergrowth); Racial Modifiers +4 Acrobatics, +4 Stealth (+8 in undergrowth)\n\n\n\nEcology   \nEnvironment  warm plains or hills \nOrganization solitary, pair, or pride (3-8)\n\nTreasure incidental   \nDescription\n\nDire lions, known locally as spotted lions or cave lions, are immense predators that can grow up to 15 feet long and weigh up to 3,500 pounds. Although they are merely animals, these large creatures seem to take an almost sadistic glee in playing with and tormenting their prey before eventually devouring it. As a result, many tribes view dire lions as the spawn of evil gods, and hunt them down as soon as their presence in a region becomes obvious.\n    </pre></div>"},"cr":{"base":5},"xp":{"value":0}},"skills":{"acr":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":6},"apr":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"art":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"blf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"clm":{"ability":"str","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"crf":{"ability":"int","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dip":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"dev":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"dis":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"esc":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"fly":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"han":{"ability":"cha","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"hea":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"int":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kar":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kdu":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"ken":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kge":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"khi":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"klo":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kna":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kno":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kpl":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"kre":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lin":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"lor":{"ability":"int","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"per":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":4},"prf":{"ability":"cha","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"pro":{"ability":"wis","rt":true,"acp":false,"rank":0},"rid":{"ability":"dex","rt":false,"acp":true,"rank":0},"sen":{"ability":"wis","rt":false,"acp":false,"rank":0},"slt":{"ability":"dex","rt":true,"acp":true,"rank":0},"sp